{"branch":"금천점","html":"<p class=\"kd-intro\">금천점의 위치와 주변 교통편을 확인하세요.</p><div class=\"kd-map-slot\" data-kakao-src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-6f0c408172293c63.html\" style=\"height:398px\"><p class=\"kd-map-pending\" role=\"status\">위치 지도를 준비하고 있습니다.</p><template><iframe class=\"kd-map-frame\" width=\"640\" height=\"398\" style=\"height:398px\" loading=\"lazy\" sandbox=\"allow-scripts\" referrerpolicy=\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\" title=\"금천점 카카오맵 지도\" src=\"/assets/kakao-directions/map-6f0c408172293c63.html\"></iframe></template></div><noscript><style>.kd-map-slot{display:none}</style><p class=\"kd-note\">위의 지도 이미지와 아래 주소를 기준으로 위치를 확인해 주세요.</p></noscript><p class=\"kd-address\"><strong>주소</strong><span>서울 금천구 금하로 763 벽산아파트 제중심상가동 3층 306~308호</span></p><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 정류장</h3><ol class=\"kd-items\"><li><span class=\"kd-number\">1</span><span>시흥2동주민센터.동일여고</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">2</span><span>제일교회</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">3</span><span>우방아파트.범일운수종점</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">4</span><span>탑동초등학교.청담종합사회복지관</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">5</span><span>탑스빌아파트.벽산6단지아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">6</span><span>탑동초등학교.청담종합사회복지관</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">7</span><span>동일여고.금천사이언스큐브</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">8</span><span>관악우방아파트</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">9</span><span>시흥동향나무.삼층석탑</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">10</span><span>시흥동향나무.삼층석탑</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">11</span><span>범일운수종점</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">12</span><span>서울시립금천청소년센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">13</span><span>서울시립금천청소년센터</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">14</span><span>범일운수종점</span></li><li><span class=\"kd-number\">15</span><span>백운한비치.금광포란재아파트</span></li></ol></div><div class=\"kd-transport\"><h3>주변 버스</h3><dl class=\"kd-buses\"><div><dt><span class=\"kd-bus-type\">마을</span></dt><dd><span>금천01</span><